{
    "title": "Fashion Show - Catwalk Battle",
    "description": "Fashion Show - Catwalk Battle is an sweet doll maker, dress-up, fashion game that we all love\r\n\r\nStart by giving you a beautiful model, let you match her with the clothes she needs to wear on the show, help her complete the challenge of one level, defeat her opponents, and finally become a world star in the show industry, setting off a fashion frenzy all over the world. Make the right choices to Build the Most Beautiful Fashion Queen\r\n\r\nAfter passing the challenge, you can unlock more fashionable and beautiful clothes to make your beautiful models more beautiful. \r\n\r\nFeature:\r\n- Customize your sweet doll with 100+ items\r\n- Unlock fashion collections so your doll\u2019s style stays on trend\r\n- Personalize your doll\u2019s outfit, skin tone, eye color, hairstyle, & makeup\r\n\r\nWhether you're a fan of project makeover games or just love all things girly, Fashion Show - Catwalk Battle is the ultimate fashion experience. Download now and start your fashion journey to becoming a top model in the makeover studio of your dreams.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Fashion Show - Catwalk Battle is an sweet doll maker, dress-up, fashion game that we all love<br><br>Start by giving you a beautiful model, let you match her with the clothes she needs to wear on the show, help her complete the challenge of one level, defeat her opponents, and finally become a world star in the show industry, setting off a fashion frenzy all over the world. Make the right choices to Build the Most Beautiful Fashion Queen<br><br>After passing the challenge, you can unlock more fashionable and beautiful clothes to make your beautiful models more beautiful. <br><br>Feature:<br>- Customize your sweet doll with 100+ items<br>- Unlock fashion collections so your doll\u2019s style stays on trend<br>- Personalize your doll\u2019s outfit, skin tone, eye color, hairstyle, &amp; makeup<br><br>Whether you&#39;re a fan of project makeover games or just love all things girly, Fashion Show - Catwalk Battle is the ultimate fashion experience. Download now and start your fashion journey to becoming a top model in the makeover studio of your dreams.",
